  title={ChronoSC: Task-Oriented Semantic Communication via Temporal-to-Color Encoding},
  author={Nguyen, P. H. and Nguyen, T. T. and Duong, Q. N. and Nguyen, Van-Dinh},
  abstract={Task-oriented semantic communication (SC) is a promising paradigm to address bandwidth constraints and latency bottlenecks in video-based tasks such as Video Question Answering (VideoQA). We propose ChronoSC, a lightweight framework utilizing Chrono-Color Stacking to collapse video temporal dynamics into a single static image for efficient DeepJSCC transmission and direct consumption by pre-trained vision-language models.},
